WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
San Juan Ermita plot, read by a computer voice.

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:08.127
Soil: repeats. The satellite saw 3 months of bare soil.

3
00:00:08.377 --> 00:00:12.764
Burning: watch. Fires seen nearby in 2 of 15 years.

4
00:00:13.014 --> 00:00:18.947
Midsummer drought: watch. Dry spells longer than 15 days in 1 of 25 years.

5
00:00:19.197 --> 00:00:23.125
There are two even options: maize with jack bean or sorghum with cowpea.

6
00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:26.428
This is not an official notice: talk it over with your extension worker.
